{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226470","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226470","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1222647001:1":{"text":"좋은 아침.","source_cn":"早上好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5481691EBFC39BF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222647002:0":{"text":"루카 씨! 깨어나셨네요!","source_cn":"卢卡！你醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CCEF3AF496E3776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222647003:1":{"text":"신세를 졌군. 나 같은 덩치를 러스트 항까지 데리고 돌아오느라 힘들었겠어.","source_cn":"麻烦你们了。把我这大块头搬回锈锚港是不是挺费劲？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x636E018C7D4158A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222647004:1":{"text":"감사 인사는 저 뒤에 있는 동료들에게 하세요.","source_cn":"要谢就谢你身后的两位同伴吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85E2F18C92ADD7AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222647005:1":{"text":"저 두 사람이 나를 데리고 돌아온 건가?","source_cn":"是他们两个把我带回来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CFAB6A8CB6CCB65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222647006:1":{"text":"헤헤... 부두목... 저희입니다.","source_cn":"嘿嘿……二当家……是我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25A7623C332BA265","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222647007:1":{"text":"어쩐지 자꾸 허리를 두드린다 했더니, 무리해서 그런 거였군.","source_cn":"我说你们怎么老是捶后腰，原来是累着了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53A06309E3CD1F15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222647008:1":{"text":"부두목! 자기 자신을 무슨 고깃덩이처럼 말하지 마세요. 부두목은 블러디 로즈에 없어서는 안 될 분이십니다!","source_cn":"二当家！别把自己说得像是一坨肉，您可是血薇帮不可或缺的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E97DC101A8DA1FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222647009:1":{"text":"너희 둘... 평소에는 공을 가로채지 못해 안달이더니 어째서 이렇게 겸손해진 거지?","source_cn":"你们两个……平时喜欢抢功劳，怎么这回谦虚起来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA91A94B73C3F85A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222647010:1":{"text":"부두목을 옮기던 도중 마차에서 떨어뜨리는 바람에 머리를 부딪치게 했다고 말할 수는 없잖습니까...","source_cn":"总不能说是因为搬运过程中不小心让您掉下马车，撞到了头……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA49AE3D2B4DFFD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222647011:1":{"text":"입 다물어! 이 멍청이! ","source_cn":"闭嘴！你这笨蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA93D3CE59034810B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222647012:1":{"text":"그만. 너희의 실수는 추궁하진 않을 거다. 그리고...","source_cn":"行了。我不会追究你们的过失。还有……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF86430C745AF64B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1222647013:1":{"text":"고맙다.","source_cn":"谢谢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91632399FB4AAAC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222647014:1":{"text":"...부두목!","source_cn":"……二当家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x668D4EE38246D389","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222647015:1":{"text":"흑흑흑... 정말 좋은 분이시네요!","source_cn":"呜呜呜……二当家真是好人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8563B62B63131C62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1222647016:1":{"text":"자, 잡담은 이제 여기까지. 소니아가 우리를 찾고 있어.","source_cn":"好了，别站在这里闲聊了，索尼娅有事找我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BBFF066F8B7B464","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_m